# ─── Touring workspace .gitignore (N02 — Master Plan H0 / QA-01) ───
# Authored 2026-06-04. Rationale: target/ + fuzz/target/ = ~4.3GB regenerable cache.
# Source (fuzz_targets/, corpus seeds, crash artifacts) is preserved intentionally.

# Build cache — regenerable (REGRA #12 disk hygiene). Matches at any nesting depth.
target/
**/target/

# cargo-mutants output
mutants.out/

# taco-forge atomic snapshots + stray compiled rlib
*.tf-bak.*
*.rlib

# Debug scratch
debug_js.js

# Build / report scratch dirs
reports/
pln2/

# Editor / OS noise
*.swp
*~
.DS_Store

# Release artifacts (published via GitHub Releases, never in-tree)
/dist/

# Per-project local state (machine, not source)
/.touring/
*.sock

# Python venvs / JS deps
.venv/
venv/
node_modules/

# Runtime/machine state & regenerable caches (never source)
/.claude/touring/
**/.fastembed_cache/
docs/baselines/*.tar.gz
/symbols.db
*.db-shm
*.db-wal

# Claude Code session state (never source)
/.claude/

# Historical plan data blobs (kept on disk, not in git)
docs/plans-archive/**/data/ground_truth.json

# ─── Agent/session state — NEVER versioned (2026-08-02, publicação do repo) ───
# Causa-raiz de vazamento REAL: .touring-cache/tfidf-memory/ indexa TRANSCRIPTS
# de sessão. Em 25/07 capturou uma GEMINI_API_KEY digitada numa linha de comando
# e a carregou para o histórico do git (commit e136e74, ancestral de v30.3.0).
# Enquanto esses caches forem tracked, qualquer credencial digitada numa sessão
# reentra no repo no commit seguinte. Removidos do histórico via git filter-repo;
# os diretórios PERMANECEM em disco — só deixam de ser publicados.
/.touring-cache/
/.cipher/
/.local-cache/
/.touring-explore/
/.full-review/
/.serena/
/.remember/
**/.ruff_cache/
**/.pytest_cache/
**/.venv/
